  {
    "date_text": "Saturday, 3 October 2026",
    "event": {
      "address": "2 Parkes Street, London E20 3AX",
      "all_day": false,
      "category": "community",
      "dedupe_key": "sansetsukon-x-es-devlin-milk|2026-10-03|v-east-storehouse",
      "description": "In MILK, Sansetsukon brings movement into the gallery, creating a dialogue between the performers, The Everythingists and the surrounding space. The performance draws on influences behind Devlin’s installation, including Rayonism and its idea of ‘new’ art doing battle with the old. It also responds to Devlin’s ideas of ‘centaurs’ (humans empowered by machines) and ‘reverse-centaurs’ (machines empowered by humans), exploring the relationship between people, technology and creativity. Dancers move through and around the gallery to a soundscape created by layering and reworking audio from The Everythingists. Light and shadow interact with the performers and surrounding space, offering audiences a new way to experience Devlin’s installation. MILK is a 25–30 minute performance taking place at 2pm, 5pm and 8pm. Dancers: Joshua Shanny-Wynter Deavion Brown Robbie Ordoña Peter Butler Tania Dimbelolo Lois Samphier Anna Watanabe Production Assistant: Becky Wong Composer: Serian Griffiths Sound Designer: Nana Nakashima Lighting Designer/operator: Oliver Pritchard @sansetsukon.mtm",
      "ends_at": "2026-10-03T19:30:00Z",
      "image_url": "https://assets-cdn.vam.ac.uk/2026/09/22/10/49/39/bb023a56-ae6b-4e5c-9034-bf95f2193cbe/sansetsukon-x-es-devlin-milk_320.jpg",
